		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Standard motor mechanism module MT250 for ComPacT NSX250, control voltage 220-240 V AC 50/60 Hz (208-277 V AC 60 Hz), consumption below 500 VA, automatic spring charging, padlocking still possible, supplied with an SDE adapter. Motor terminals M1-M2 ASSUMED.</elementInformation>
